;Oden::DSKG:ALLTAB.MAC<62,7777,MAC> 1986-02-14 18:07:46, Edit by KPJ
;14	CREATE USER and CREATE CONFERENCE optionally privileged operations.
;Oden::DSKD:ALLTAB.MAC<62,7777,MAC> 1985-10-01 01:22:09, Edit by KPJ
;13	Introduced PROLOG macro.
;Oden::DSKD:ALLTAB.MAC<62,7777,MAC> 1985-08-05 18:55:55, Edit by KPJ @ DECGR
;12	COMPUTE command put under FTCOMP feature switch.
;Oden::DSKD:ALLTAB.MAC<62,7777,MAC> 1985-06-19 22:38:38, Edit by KPJ @ Nadja
;11	Moved EDIT command table (TXTTAB) here from EDIT module.
;Oden::DSKD:ALLTAB.MAC<62,7777,MAC> 1985-05-06 13:14:23, Edit by KPJ @ L89
;10	Added READ (FROM) PERSONAL COMPUTER.
;Oden::DSKD:ALLTAB.MAC[62,7777] 1984-11-22 12:18:49, Edit by THOLERUS T
;7	Added LIST LETTERS command.
;Oden::DSKD:ALLTAB.MAC[62,7777] 1984-11-19 13:54:07, Edit by K.JAAKKOLA
;6	Moved all texts to TEXTER.MAC
;Oden::DSKD:ALLTAB.MAC[62,7777] 1984-11-12 19:26:37, Edit by K.JAAKKOLA
;5	Added LOGOUT and fixed READ FILE/L[S FIL problem.
;Oden::DSKD:ALLTAB.MAC[62,7777] 1984-08-06 13:52:24, Edit by THOLERUS T
;4	Added VERIFY NAME command [TTQ.4]
;Oden::Dskd:Alltab.Mac[62,7777] 1984-05-11 16:29:39, Edit by KPJ Jaakkola
;3	Various changes in the Norwegian menus. Updated copyright notice
;Oden::Dskd:Alltab.Mac[62,7777] 1984-04-26 10:59:20, Editor: KPJ Jaakkola
